[size=5][b]SecretChecklist[/b][/size]

WoW is full of secrets that the game never tells you about — hidden mounts, pets, toys, achievements, appearances and housing decor, found by the community and documented nowhere in-game.

SecretChecklist keeps track of them for you. It knows what you've already collected the moment you log in, and shows you exactly what's left.

[size=4][b]What it does[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Shows you where you stand.[/b] Every secret in one Collections-style window, coloured when you have it, greyed when you don't.
[*][b]Walks you through the ones you're missing.[/b] Every secret has a step-by-step guide, and steps tick themselves off as you go. Click a step with a location and it drops a map pin.
[*][b]Finds anything fast.[/b] Search by name, by zone, or by anything mentioned in the steps — "Kosumoth" and "Tazavesh" both work.
[*][b]Shows you the reward[/b] in 3D before you go after it, including appearances on your own character.
[*][b]Tells you when you get one[/b], with a toast the moment it registers.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Doing the Beledar raid?[/b][/size]

The Radiant Singer secret needs 40 players performing emotes in sequence at the Divine Flame. SecretChecklist gets you your slot and your emote automatically — [b]only the raid leader needs the BeledarOrchestra addon[/b], everyone else just needs this.

[size=4][b]Also[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Matches your UI: Default, ElvUI or EllesmereUI
[*]Collected and missing use a checkmark and a cross, not just colour
[*]Available in 11 languages
[*]Minimap button, or [b]/secrets[/b]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Credits[/b][/size]

Every secret in this addon was found by the community at the [url=https://discord.gg/wowsecrets]Secret Finding Discord[/url]. They did the detective work — this just keeps score.

Bugs and suggestions: [url=https://github.com/rousseauxy/SecretChecklist]github.com/rousseauxy/SecretChecklist[/url]

